<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces are pushing forward in Tigray while militia attacks near the Kenya border have killed civilians in Moyale and displaced thousands. Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, leading to diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Drone and artillery strikes have occurred between Ethiopia and Eritrea near Badme, and Eritrea is accused of directing a Tigray rebel offensive with Egyptian support. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBvR0ZFTTdYWHlfOVJZeWMxUnZDZ3NMZ2tnb1BYeFdSR3FzZ0FsQWZKYmNFYjdQUkhSVE5nMFFpS2RpQXhNRkN6ZnNlZlFPcnJQRi1jZ2hOb2hBVlVVN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNUkhZY3JnZHdlckh5eWxYZ3MtN0VZakJ6UERrOWNGd0J1VDZrR3ZxNlpjQ1YxSlVEOGIzLWdUcWg4dFJ6N3NGTi1HaEM2TXFTUHQ5eEEtd3JoeGZOS3Y2YVM5ckZOWkF3bmJxaTE2MjdQWHB0TnM0WUdFZDR3YzdBZlc3OXA2dnI2ekJseHFfdzZ0SzlrdmhxX2NSVTUtc2hralpmS1FVak00R3ZYYnpEeGl5SDRLZDhMaTY0aFJWOThUekE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBOWTE1alRLV2lvRVdXdGN2djhudk5HZThrMXhPcDg4eEJIS0dtVHdCNUZzNlNfaDVTSEswaVI5ODFuanBGbU92MTQ2b19fNG94SFQ2NWI4S0hDU2J4NTFsZDFqdDhweERmdkxDU1J3V1R3VGM?oc=5&quot;&g